docs {
Masuk dengan Facebook (access token Graph). V1: client_type mobile.

200 sukses (mobile):

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiJ9...",
        "expires_in": 900,
        "refresh_token": "8f3a...",
        "user": { "id": "01JD...", "username": "...", "role": "contributor" }
      }
    }

401 INVALID_FACEBOOK_TOKEN (token / app_id / email absen / akun nonaktif):

    { "success": false, "error_code": "INVALID_FACEBOOK_TOKEN", "message": "Tidak bisa masuk dengan Facebook.", "details": null }

Email provider bentrok: tetap 200 - akun baru dengan email sintetis
(fb_{id}@users.noreply.sambasku.local), bukan 409.

503 FACEBOOK_AUTH_UNAVAILABLE (FACEBOOK_APP_ID / FACEBOOK_APP_SECRET kosong):

    { "success": false, "error_code": "FACEBOOK_AUTH_UNAVAILABLE", "message": "Masuk dengan Facebook sedang tidak tersedia.", "details": null }
}

meta {
  name: Login Facebook
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/facebook
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "access_token": "{{facebook_access_token}}",
    "client_type": "mobile"
  }
}

tests {
  test("status 200 + refresh_token di body, TANPA Set-Cookie", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.data.refresh_token).to.be.a('string');
    expect(res.body.data.access_token).to.exist;
    const raw = res.headers['set-cookie'];
    const setCookies = Array.isArray(raw) ? raw : raw ? [raw] : [];
    expect(setCookies.length).to.equal(0);
  });
}
